Fix
Compute the slot count in 64-bit and clamp on the page-size limit, so the multiplication cannot wrap and a corrupt nElem cannot drive a downstream allocation:
i64 nSlot64 = MAX((i64)nElem * 4, MINSLOT);
if( nSlot64 > nSlotPerPage ){
nOut = 0;
}else{
nSlot = (int)nSlot64;
