The assert fires in the SQLITE_DEBUG build (SIGABRT). In a release / NDEBUG build the assert is removed and the same path is a NULL pointer dereference (SIGSEGV) inside strHash().

Fix
unionConnect() must reject a NULL table name from the source query instead of letting it propagate:
/* ext/misc/unionvtab.c: unionConnect(), per-source-row handling */
const char *zTab = (const char*)sqlite3_column_text(pStmt, 1);
if( zTab==0 ){
*pzErr = sqlite3_mprintf("unionvtab: source table name is NULL");
rc = SQLITE_ERROR;
break;
}
pSrc->zTab = unionStrdup(&rc, zTab);

