fuzzerFilter() (ext/misc/fuzzer.c:984) sets zWord = (const char*)sqlite3_value_text(argv[0]) when the MATCH argument is present, then calls strlen(zWord) at line 1006 with no NULL check. A SQL NULL MATCH argument makes sqlite3_value_text return NULL, so strlen(NULL) dereferences address 0 (CWE-476).

